{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of all of the positive integer divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95abd0ed162de8f742f3685bf1a9d857099935a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2=36$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e64d1823c10f9befb27fc5c13e02d019e1fedc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+4+6+9+12+18+36=91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"328\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>(a) Determine a nice closed formula (i.e. without dots or the summation symbol) for the sum of all positive divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f156c838ae7d194e36ebf402316e89d42740431a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>(b) Repeat for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf4e2cb180f9fd5c9599e2ca4fed24f6d71f6a1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>(c) Generalize.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb3800340458cb4ca96917d9cfbb0f7122fbc33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^{n+1}-1)(3^{n+1}-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"163\" height=\"39\" /> \n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d408514340b6ea41e370469ea83d9e755f7603b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^{2n+1}-1)(3^{n+1}-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"169\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> 